<!-- PROBLEM -->
<section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-center text-center mb-5">
            <div class="col-lg-8" data-aos="fade-up">
                <div class="eyebrow justify-content-center">The Problem</div>

                <h2 class="display-6 mb-3">Small Website Problems Can Create Big Business Problems</h2>

                <p class="lead text-secondary">
                    You can have a good business and a decent-looking website and still lose customers because a
                    few important things simply aren't working the way they should.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up">
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-number">01 / PERFORMANCE</div>
                    <h3 class="h5">Your site feels slow</h3>
                    <p class="mb-0">
                        Oversized assets, poor scripts, plugins and frontend issues can make visitors abandon
                        the page before they ever see your offer.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="50">
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-number">02 / MOBILE</div>
                    <h3 class="h5">Mobile visitors struggle</h3>
                    <p class="mb-0">
                        Text is hard to read, buttons are awkward, layouts break or important actions disappear
                        on smaller screens.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-number">03 / FORMS</div>
                    <h3 class="h5">Leads can't contact you</h3>
                    <p class="mb-0">
                        Forms may fail silently, notifications may never arrive or unnecessary fields may
                        prevent visitors from completing them.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up">
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-number">04 / UX</div>
                    <h3 class="h5">The next step isn't clear</h3>
                    <p class="mb-0">
                        Visitors reach your site, look around and leave because the page never makes the next
                        action obvious.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="50">
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-number">05 / TECHNICAL</div>
                    <h3 class="h5">Something is broken</h3>
                    <p class="mb-0">
                        WordPress plugins, integrations, JavaScript, DNS, SSL or deployment issues shouldn't
                        become permanent parts of your website.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-number">06 / TRACKING</div>
                    <h3 class="h5">You're flying blind</h3>
                    <p class="mb-0">
                        Analytics or conversion tracking may be missing or inaccurate, making it impossible to
                        know what's actually working.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- SOLUTION -->
