<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row g-5">
            <div class="col-lg-5" data-aos="fade-right">
                <div class="eyebrow">Questions</div>

                <h2 class="display-6">Before You Send Your Website</h2>

                <p class="lead text-secondary">
                    The goal is to keep this simple, fast and focused on getting meaningful improvements
                    shipped.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-7" data-aos="fade-left">
                <div class="accordion" id="rescueFaq">
                    <div class="accordion-item">
                        <h3 class="accordion-header">
                            <button
                            class="accordion-button"
                            type="button"
                            data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#faqOne"
                            >
                            Can you really complete work within 48 hours?
                        </button>
                    </h3>

                    <div id="faqOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#rescueFaq">
                        <div class="accordion-body text-secondary">
                            The Website Rescue package is structured around a defined number of improvements that can reasonably be completed within the delivery window. If the site requires more substantial work, I'll recommend a larger sprint rather than promise an unrealistic turnaround.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h3 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqTwo">
                            What kinds of websites can you work on?
                        </button>
                    </h3>

                    <div id="faqTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#rescueFaq">
                        <div class="accordion-body text-secondary">
                            I can evaluate WordPress websites, custom sites, landing pages and web applications. Send the URL and a short explanation of the problem and I'll determine whether it's something I can help with.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h3 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqThree">
                            What if I don't know what's wrong?
                        </button>
                    </h3>

                    <div id="faqThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#rescueFaq">
                        <div class="accordion-body text-secondary">
                            That's fine. Tell me what you're seeing. For example, fewer leads, slow pages, strange mobile behavior or technical errors. The review is designed to identify the underlying issues and prioritize what matters most.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h3 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqFour">
                            Does this include a complete website redesign?
                        </button>
                    </h3>

                    <div id="faqFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#rescueFaq">
                        <div class="accordion-body text-secondary">
                            No. These packages intentionally focus on specific, high-impact improvements. If the review shows that a full redesign makes more sense, I'll explain why rather than forcing it into a rescue package.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h3 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqFive">
                            Can you help after the initial fixes?
                        </button>
                    </h3>

                    <div id="faqFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#rescueFaq">
                        <div class="accordion-body text-secondary">
                            Yes. The rescue can be a one-time project or the starting point for additional development, optimization, integrations or ongoing technical support.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</section>

